\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces TBR dependence on Lead fraction in a simplified non-eutectic / constant packing factor $\text  {Li}_{(100-x)}\text  {Pb}_x$ breeder, where the density is calculated as a simple weighted average of \ce {Li} and \ce {Pb}. Breeding performance peaks at approximately 50\% lead concentration, with a rapid decline observed beyond 75\%. The eutectic point is marked for reference, far exceeding any non-eutectic TBR. Error bars are included but are too small to be visible at this scale.}}{14}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
