\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Analysis of Breeder Blanket radial thickness. (a) TBR saturates at approximately 500 mm, suggesting full neutron attenuation. (b) Cross-sectional heatmap of reaction density. The reaction rate drops to negligible levels beyond the $640-580=60$cm depth into the blanket, confirming the saturation thickness observed in (a).}}{17}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:blanket_thicknesses}{{10}{17}{Analysis of Breeder Blanket radial thickness. (a) TBR saturates at approximately 500 mm, suggesting full neutron attenuation. (b) Cross-sectional heatmap of reaction density. The reaction rate drops to negligible levels beyond the $640-580=60$cm depth into the blanket, confirming the saturation thickness observed in (a)}{figure.caption.12}{}}
